+
+- Severity: medium
+- Date found: 2026-08-09
+- Watch day: D07
+- Originating task: `SLT-MYA-03` / card `#94`
+- Plan file: `kanban/tasks/094-update-the-paddle-payment-method-and-prove-the.md`
+
