+
+- Subscription: `12639` (`SLT Paddle Daily`, arraysubs-active)
+- Product: `12112` (`SLT Paddle Daily`)
+- Parent order: `12629`
+- Renewal order: `13249`
+- Paddle subscription: `sub_01kz8q1025tryjfgxvn5e3v4gf`
+- Paddle transaction: `txn_01kzge82gz7pyqne0x1prnmf6a`
+
