+- Sanitized Paddle state: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-MYA-03-paddle-api-before.json` and `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-MYA-03-paddle-api-after.json`
+- Customer UI screenshots:
